# SQLite WAL/SHM sidecar files are regenerated automatically whenever the DB is opened
# (backend/sync both use journal_mode=WAL) — they hold no data that isn't already in
# data/jellite.sqlite once checkpointed, so they must never be committed.
data/jellite.sqlite-wal
data/jellite.sqlite-shm
